## Registration

After class definition:
```python
ScopeIndicatorOrchestrator.register({Name}ScopeCalculator)
```

## Checklist per calculator

- [ ] SQL matches per-lot parent's WHERE clauses (check `INDICATOR_LOGIC_REFERENCE.md`)
- [ ] DA-5 entity scoping correct (market vs scope-entity-only)
- [ ] `self._normalize_value(value, indicator)` — pass full IndicatorDefinition, NOT threshold
- [ ] `self._check_threshold(value, indicator.threshold, indicator.threshold_operator)`
- [ ] StepTracker v2 in `calculation_metadata`
- [ ] `is_subject` flag in entity `calculation_metadata` for target entities
- [ ] Data sufficiency: per-indicator minimums from `INDICATOR_POOLS_BY_SCOPE.md` DA-1
- [ ] `deleted_at IS NULL` on every joined table
- [ ] Contract filters for HHI: `is_framework_agreement = false`, `doc_type IN ('Līgums','contract')`, no terminated
